menu "diag: output fan-out"

    config DIAG_MAX_SINKS
        int "Maximum registered output sinks"
        default 4
        range 1 16
        help
            How many sinks may be attached at once, besides stdout. One per
            interface that must see command and log output -- a WebSocket
            console, an MQTT log topic, a file on the filesystem. The table is
            statically sized, so this costs memory whether or not it is used.

    config DIAG_FORMAT_BUF_SIZE
        int "Output formatting buffer size (bytes)"
        default 512
        range 128 4096
        help
            Output is formatted once into this buffer and then handed to stdout
            and to every sink, so all interfaces see byte-identical text. A line
            longer than this is truncated, not split. Statically allocated.

endmenu
